        "pitch": "Imagine a world bathed in warm, golden light. The film centers on Pip, a ridiculously cute corgi, utterly exhausted after a day of chasing butterflies and playing fetch. He collapses onto a mountain of plush blankets \u2013 it's almost comical, the sheer volume of coziness. As he drifts off, we enter his dream. Initially, it's a hyper-realistic extension of his day: giant, slow-motion butterflies with shimmering wings, tennis balls that bounce impossibly high, and rivers of delicious-smelling snacks. Then, things get wonderfully surreal. The bed transforms into a giant, fluffy cloud, floating through a sky filled with playful sheep. Pip begins to subtly morph into a tiny, knightly figure, bravely navigating a landscape sculpted from his favorite chew toys. The soundtrack goes from gentle, comforting music to playful orchestral swells, punctuated by the soft 'thump' of his contented sighs. We end with him fully asleep, a tiny, heroic corgi dreaming the most delightful nap imaginable, and a lingering shot of the impossibly cozy bed \u2013 a visual promise of pure, unadulterated comfort.",
